{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.SchurWeyl.MolienSymmetrisingTrace","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.SchurWeyl.MolienSymmetrisingTrace","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:QOU.SchurWeyl.WenzlMarkovTraceInstance","lean:module:QOU.SchurWeyl.OcneanuWeightWenzl","lean:module:QOU.SchurWeyl.BranchingGenericity","lean:module:QOU.SchurWeyl.SymmetrisingTraceZeroParam"],"declarations":17,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.SchurWeyl.SeminormalRep.wtraceW_ocneanu_zero_eq_molien","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.SchurWeyl.SeminormalRep.wtraceW_ocneanu_zero_eq_molien","kind":"theorem","line":272,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/SchurWeyl/MolienSymmetrisingTrace.lean#L272-L279","doc":"**Molien is the `z = 0` Ocneanu trace** — the same statement read through\n`ocneanuWeight_zero_eq_molienWeight`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.SchurWeyl.SeminormalRep.eq_molien_of_zero","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.SchurWeyl.SeminormalRep.eq_molien_of_zero","kind":"theorem","line":266,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/SchurWeyl/MolienSymmetrisingTrace.lean#L266-L270","doc":"**Every `z = 0` Markov trace is the Molien-weighted seminormal trace.** ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.SchurWeyl.SeminormalRep.molienMarkovTrace_symmetrising","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.SchurWeyl.SeminormalRep.molienMarkovTrace_symmetrising","kind":"theorem","line":256,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/SchurWeyl/MolienSymmetrisingTrace.lean#L256-L264","doc":"**Molien equals the symmetrising trace.**  On the coset basis of every `H_n(q)`, the\nMolien-weighted seminormal trace is `1` at the identity and `0` at every other element. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.SchurWeyl.SeminormalRep.molienMarkovTrace_tr","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.SchurWeyl.SeminormalRep.molienMarkovTrace_tr","kind":"theorem","line":253,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/SchurWeyl/MolienSymmetrisingTrace.lean#L253-L254","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.SchurWeyl.SeminormalRep.molienMarkovTrace","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.SchurWeyl.SeminormalRep.molienMarkovTrace","kind":"def","line":242,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/SchurWeyl/MolienSymmetrisingTrace.lean#L242-L251","doc":"**The Molien Markov trace**: the seminormal trace weighted by `M_μ(q²)`, a Markov trace with\nparameter `z = 0`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.SchurWeyl.SeminormalRep.markov_molienWeight","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.SchurWeyl.SeminormalRep.markov_molienWeight","kind":"theorem","line":225,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/SchurWeyl/MolienSymmetrisingTrace.lean#L225-L240","doc":"**The Markov corner identity for the Molien weight, at `z = 0`.** ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.SchurWeyl.sum_molienWeight_mul_eq_zero","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.SchurWeyl.sum_molienWeight_mul_eq_zero","kind":"theorem","line":176,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/SchurWeyl/MolienSymmetrisingTrace.lean#L176-L215","doc":"**The Markov corner at `z = 0`, abstractly.**  If, at every level `r ≥ 1`, a pair of\n`F`-valued data `t, t'` satisfies the level-`r` Markov identity with parameter\n`Q^r/(q·[r]_Q)`, then the Molien-weighted sum of `t` vanishes. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.SchurWeyl.sum_addable_molienWeight","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.SchurWeyl.sum_addable_molienWeight","kind":"theorem","line":158,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/SchurWeyl/MolienSymmetrisingTrace.lean#L158-L174","doc":"**Branching**: `Σ_{s addable} M_{ν+s} = M_ν`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.SchurWeyl.sum_dim_molienWeight_eq_one","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.SchurWeyl.sum_dim_molienWeight_eq_one","kind":"theorem","line":135,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/SchurWeyl/MolienSymmetrisingTrace.lean#L135-L156","doc":"**Normalisation**: `Σ_{|ν| = n} f^ν M_ν = 1`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.SchurWeyl.eval_zero_eq_of_eval_pow","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.SchurWeyl.eval_zero_eq_of_eval_pow","kind":"theorem","line":121,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/SchurWeyl/MolienSymmetrisingTrace.lean#L121-L133","doc":"**Interpolation.**  Two polynomials agreeing at every `Q^r`, `r ≥ 1`, agree at `0`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.SchurWeyl.pow_succ_injective","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.SchurWeyl.pow_succ_injective","kind":"theorem","line":109,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/SchurWeyl/MolienSymmetrisingTrace.lean#L109-L119","doc":"Powers `Q^{r+1}` of a non-root-of-unity are pairwise distinct. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.SchurWeyl.eval_pow_wenzlPoly","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.SchurWeyl.eval_pow_wenzlPoly","kind":"theorem","line":96,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/SchurWeyl/MolienSymmetrisingTrace.lean#L96-L107","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.SchurWeyl.eval_zero_wenzlPoly","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.SchurWeyl.eval_zero_wenzlPoly","kind":"theorem","line":91,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/SchurWeyl/MolienSymmetrisingTrace.lean#L91-L94","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.SchurWeyl.eval_wenzlPoly","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.SchurWeyl.eval_wenzlPoly","kind":"theorem","line":86,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/SchurWeyl/MolienSymmetrisingTrace.lean#L86-L89","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.SchurWeyl.wenzlPoly","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.SchurWeyl.wenzlPoly","kind":"def","line":82,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/SchurWeyl/MolienSymmetrisingTrace.lean#L82-L84","doc":"The **interpolating polynomial** `W_μ(a)`: level `r` at `a = Q^r`, Molien at `a = 0`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.SchurWeyl.ocneanuWeight_zero_eq_molienWeight","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.SchurWeyl.ocneanuWeight_zero_eq_molienWeight","kind":"theorem","line":72,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/SchurWeyl/MolienSymmetrisingTrace.lean#L72-L80","doc":"**The Molien weight is the Ocneanu weight at Markov parameter `z = 0`.** ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.SchurWeyl.molienWeight","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.SchurWeyl.molienWeight","kind":"def","line":68,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/SchurWeyl/MolienSymmetrisingTrace.lean#L68-L70","doc":"The **Molien weight** `M_μ(Q) = Q^{n(μ)} ∏_x (1 − Q)/(1 − Q^{h(x)})`. ","signatureChunk":0}]}